@startuml
' Supporting document: ../references/examples.md#interaction-and-lifecycle-late-payment-authorization
' Scope: Held/Expired/Confirmed transitions; payment retries excluded. Designation: proposed-design, teaching only.
!pragma layout smetana
title Revision: expiry prevents confirmation
[*] --> Held
Held --> Expired : expire
Held --> Confirmed : confirmIfHeld(paymentAuthorized) [still Held]
Expired --> Expired : confirmIfHeld(paymentAuthorized) / refuse
note bottom of Expired
  Refusal leaves allocation expired.
  Checkout voids the late authorization.
end note
@enduml
